href=\"/wiki/Devour_Intellect\" title=\"Devour Intellect\">Devour Intellect</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Synaptic_Discharge\" title=\"Synaptic Discharge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp/25px-Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp/38px-Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp/50px-Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Synaptic Discharge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp/25px-Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Synaptic_Discharge_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Synaptic_Discharge\" title=\"Synaptic Discharge\">Synaptic Discharge</a> abilities.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Intellect_Devourer\"> Creature: Intellect Devourer </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Devourer\" title=\"Intellect Devourer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Intellect_Devourer.png/120px-Portrait_Intellect_Devourer.png.webp, /w/images/7/7f/Portrait_Intellect_Devourer.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Intellect_Devourer.png/120px-Portrait_Intellect_Devourer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Portrait_Intellect_Devourer.p